{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "第二天。", "text_idx": 188, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在万智老师的协助之下，\\n我们得以开展了长时间的临时班会。", "text_idx": 189, "plain": "在万智老师的协助之下，我们得以开展了长时间的临时班会。", "plain_idx": 190, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「也就是说，现在我们的校长，\\n　为了能让明年两校正式合并，\\n　正全力奋斗在第一线……！」", "text_idx": 192, "plain": "「也就是说，现在我们的校长，　为了能让明年两校正式合并，　正全力奋斗在第一线……！」", "plain_idx": 193, "len": 46, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3153", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "爱理和我，在与万智老师商谈后提出来的议题，\\n直白来说……就是“关于合并”。", "text_idx": 195, "plain": "爱理和我，在与万智老师商谈后提出来的议题，直白来说……就是“关于合并”。", "plain_idx": 196, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "包括校长所遭遇的现状，\\n也都和班里同学一五一十的道明了。", "text_idx": 197, "plain": "包括校长所遭遇的现状，也都和班里同学一五一十的道明了。", "plain_idx": 198, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……抱歉，本来不应该把这事挑明的」", "text_idx": 199, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唉……虽然话是这么说啦」", "text_idx": 200, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mc0177", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不过也没关系，我已经下定决心了。\\n　为了我的学生，不管是开除还是降薪，鬼才怕呢」", "text_idx": 202, "plain": "「不过也没关系，我已经下定决心了。　为了我的学生，不管是开除还是降薪，鬼才怕呢」", "plain_idx": 203, "len": 42, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mc0178", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「大伙，到目前为止我说的都能明白吧？」", "text_idx": 205, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mc0179", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "结女校学生A", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「虽，虽然是懂了……」", "text_idx": 208, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ja0047", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "各务台校女生B", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是也……」", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sb0035", "char_id": "各務台女子Ｂ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，虽这么说，\\n　但身为一介学生的我们究竟能不能帮得上忙的意思对吧……」", "text_idx": 213, "plain": "「嗯，虽这么说，　但身为一介学生的我们究竟能不能帮得上忙的意思对吧……」", "plain_idx": 214, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是难道不想尽自己一份力吗！」", "text_idx": 215, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3154", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "爱理用认真的眼神环视着全班同学。", "text_idx": 217, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「毕竟……我也想要正式合并啊！」", "text_idx": 218, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3155", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "教室内一瞬间鸦雀无声。", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大家也都面面相觑。", "text_idx": 221, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "结女校学生C", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……所以有什么打算吗？」", "text_idx": 223, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "jc0036", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，所以我打算让大家签个联名书！！\\n　今天也是因此才召开长时间临时班会的」", "text_idx": 225, "plain": "「嗯，所以我打算让大家签个联名书！！　今天也是因此才召开长时间临时班会的」", "plain_idx": 226, "len": 39, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3156", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这就是我与爱理，还有万智老师一同提出的，\\n“自己力所能及之事”。", "text_idx": 228, "plain": "这就是我与爱理，还有万智老师一同提出的，“自己力所能及之事”。", "plain_idx": 229, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就结果而言，身为学生的我们除了把事情全权委托给校长之外，\\n　什么也做不到」", "text_idx": 230, "plain": "「就结果而言，身为学生的我们除了把事情全权委托给校长之外，　什么也做不到」", "plain_idx": 231, "len": 39, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3157", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是，也正因如此，才希望能联名上书。\\n　来表达有这么多的学生，都在期待着合并」", "text_idx": 233, "plain": "「但是，也正因如此，才希望能联名上书。　来表达有这么多的学生，都在期待着合并」", "plain_idx": 234, "len": 41, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3158", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「把大家的感情向那个人传达过去……\\n　想让那个人能获得干劲！！」", "text_idx": 236, "plain": "「把大家的感情向那个人传达过去……　想让那个人能获得干劲！！」", "plain_idx": 237, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3159", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
