{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "结女校学生A", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我们倒是无所谓啦……\\n　倒是你突然一反常态……」", "text_idx": 259, "plain": "「我们倒是无所谓啦……　倒是你突然一反常态……」", "plain_idx": 260, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ja0048", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「虽……虽然，曾经是那样……但是……」", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3164", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "各务台校女生A", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「而且濑名同学，你大概只是单纯不想和瓜生分开吧～？」", "text_idx": 265, "plain": "「而且濑名同学，你大概只是单纯不想和瓜生分开吧～？」", "plain_idx": 265, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sa0031", "char_id": "各務台女子Ａ"}]}
