{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以说！我只是希望校长能在正式合并上加把劲儿而已！！」", "text_idx": 290, "plain": "「所以说！我只是希望校长能在正式合并上加把劲儿而已！！」", "plain_idx": 290, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3167", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "结女校学生B", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「又在偷换话题了」", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "jb0027", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｂ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "结女校学生C", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你还真敢讲啊，自己还摆着一副道貌岸然的样子」", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "jc0040", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「～～～～……」", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3168", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "比起提议这件事，现在感觉更像是\\n爱理自身被人排挤一样——", "text_idx": 298, "plain": "比起提议这件事，现在感觉更像是爱理自身被人排挤一样——", "plain_idx": 299, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不论说什么，都不顶用。", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "教室内的气氛每一秒都在进一步恶化。", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……所以说，都消停一下。\\n　没必要在这里对别人进行人身攻击吧」", "text_idx": 302, "plain": "「……所以说，都消停一下。　没必要在这里对别人进行人身攻击吧」", "plain_idx": 303, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不管怎样，此时的我只能帮爱理打圆场。", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然而。", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "各务台校男生A", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……到头来，瓜生你这家伙果然也是这样」", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "da0032", "char_id": "各務台男子Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「诶？」", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "各务台校男生B", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哦。临时并校刚开始那会儿，\\n　你一马当先地融入班级，\\n　总觉得怪怪的」", "text_idx": 309, "plain": "「哦。临时并校刚开始那会儿，　你一马当先地融入班级，　总觉得怪怪的」", "plain_idx": 310, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "db0022", "char_id": "各務台男子Ｂ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "各务台校女生B", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「结果还不是只是想追到濑名同学吗？\\n　总觉得是这样」", "text_idx": 312, "plain": "「结果还不是只是想追到濑名同学吗？　总觉得是这样」", "plain_idx": 313, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sb0037", "char_id": "各務台女子Ｂ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "各务台校女生C", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊～」", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sc0029", "char_id": "各務台女子Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "各务台校男生A", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你这人怎么这样呢……真让人受不了啊」", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "da0033", "char_id": "各務台男子Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大家的反抗的矛头，\\n不仅指向了爱理，也指向了我。", "text_idx": 320, "plain": "大家的反抗的矛头，不仅指向了爱理，也指向了我。", "plain_idx": 321, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "明明之前一路都很顺利，现在却又行不通了。", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「都，都消停下。大家都安静一下……\\n　稍微冷静下来听一下他们的话吧，成吗……」", "text_idx": 323, "plain": "「都，都消停下。大家都安静一下……　稍微冷静下来听一下他们的话吧，成吗……」", "plain_idx": 324, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mc0181", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3169", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "爱理也束手无策，一脸茫然地望向了我。", "text_idx": 327, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『现在怎么办啊……？！』", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『这样下去的话……』", "text_idx": 329, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "情况不言而喻。", "text_idx": 330, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "反抗的视线与呼声充斥在教室之中，\\n我和爱理在讲台上也似乎无地自容。", "text_idx": 331, "plain": "反抗的视线与呼声充斥在教室之中，我和爱理在讲台上也似乎无地自容。", "plain_idx": 332, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「——！！」", "text_idx": 333, "plain": "「——！！」", "plain_idx": 333, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "——场面令人窒息。", "text_idx": 334, "plain": "——场面令人窒息。", "plain_idx": 334, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "气氛也糟糕透顶。", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这也多半……是我的责任。", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哈，啊」", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "自己迄今为止的言行举止。", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我又重新回味了一遍。", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "讲真，像这样因为自己的原因导致气氛变糟的时候，\\n我或是缄口不语，或者逃之夭夭，\\n但是现在……", "text_idx": 340, "plain": "讲真，像这样因为自己的原因导致气氛变糟的时候，我或是缄口不语，或者逃之夭夭，但是现在……", "plain_idx": 341, "len": 48, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾……」", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3170", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「————！」", "text_idx": 344, "plain": "「————！」", "plain_idx": 344, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "爱理那想要执于我手的指尖，\\n如今推动着我前行。", "text_idx": 345, "plain": "爱理那想要执于我手的指尖，如今推动着我前行。", "plain_idx": 346, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我深吸了一口气。", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "%123;「我，已经遇到了！！！」", "text_idx": 348, "plain": "「俺は、出会ってしまったの！！！」", "plain_idx": 349, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "教室内的聒噪戛然而止。", "text_idx": 350, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就是校长所说的“另一半”！！」", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在大家张口结舌欲言又止，教室内一片鸦雀无声之中——\\n我将我对爱理的思慕倾吐而出。", "text_idx": 352, "plain": "在大家张口结舌欲言又止，教室内一片鸦雀无声之中——我将我对爱理的思慕倾吐而出。", "plain_idx": 353, "len": 41, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因为爱理比我所见任何人都要更为光彩夺目，\\n　我的心早已为她所深深吸引」", "text_idx": 354, "plain": "「因为爱理比我所见任何人都要更为光彩夺目，　我的心早已为她所深深吸引」", "plain_idx": 355, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「诶，啊，诶……」", "text_idx": 356, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3171", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「爱理比任何人都要更为努力这件事，\\n　想必大家也早已心知肚明……」", "text_idx": 358, "plain": "「爱理比任何人都要更为努力这件事，　想必大家也早已心知肚明……」", "plain_idx": 359, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "浑身冷汗涔涔。\\n脑袋充血，身子也兴奋地不听使唤。", "text_idx": 360, "plain": "浑身冷汗涔涔。脑袋充血，身子也兴奋地不听使唤。", "plain_idx": 361, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "即便如此也不能够停下来。", "text_idx": 362, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为这是我心头所念之事。", "text_idx": 363, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「大家也感觉得到吧？自从我们来了之后，\\n　爱理也开始逐渐发生改变」", "text_idx": 364, "plain": "「大家也感觉得到吧？自从我们来了之后，　爱理也开始逐渐发生改变」", "plain_idx": 365, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「曾经那个凛若冰霜难以接近的爱理，如今不也是变得能让大家无所顾虑地\\n　挑毛拣刺了吗……」", "text_idx": 366, "plain": "「曾经那个凛若冰霜难以接近的爱理，如今不也是变得能让大家无所顾虑地　挑毛拣刺了吗……」", "plain_idx": 367, "len": 45, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「爱理其实完全就是一个破绽百出，让人不忍心抛之不顾的女孩子，\\n　大家也该明白了吧？！」", "text_idx": 368, "plain": "「爱理其实完全就是一个破绽百出，让人不忍心抛之不顾的女孩子，　大家也该明白了吧？！」", "plain_idx": 369, "len": 44, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新……新……吾」", "text_idx": 370, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3172", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我一个堂堂男儿，遇到了这样的女孩子的话，\\n　肯定是会坠入爱河的啊！」", "text_idx": 372, "plain": "「我一个堂堂男儿，遇到了这样的女孩子的话，　肯定是会坠入爱河的啊！」", "plain_idx": 373, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那，那什么，新吾，已经够了……」", "text_idx": 374, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3173", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这份感情，因这份思绪，\\n绝不是会令我感到内疚的东西——", "text_idx": 376, "plain": "这份感情，因这份思绪，绝不是会令我感到内疚的东西——", "plain_idx": 377, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就是因为爱理变成了结女校里的“好女人”，\\n　我才会喜欢上的！！」", "text_idx": 378, "plain": "「就是因为爱理变成了结女校里的“好女人”，　我才会喜欢上的！！」", "plain_idx": 379, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我就站在讲台上，对着班里众人，扯着嗓门。", "text_idx": 380, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……大秀恩爱。", "text_idx": 381, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那，那什么，我……我，哈呜……」", "text_idx": 382, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3174", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "爱理满脸通红。", "text_idx": 384, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过，我的脸可能比她更红。", "text_idx": 385, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……抱歉，爱理」", "text_idx": 386, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「笨蛋……！」", "text_idx": 387, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3175", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后，方才鸦雀无声的众人——", "text_idx": 389, "plain": "然后，方才鸦雀无声的众人——", "plain_idx": 389, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": "通用", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "%123;「烦欸～～～～～！！」", "text_idx": 392, "plain": "「うっぜぇぇ～～～～～っ！！」", "plain_idx": 393, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "全班同学", "alt_speaker_idx": 391, "voice": "go056", "char_id": "汎用"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大家一同对着面红耳赤的我俩，\\n高声笑了起来。", "text_idx": 395, "plain": "大家一同对着面红耳赤的我俩，高声笑了起来。", "plain_idx": 396, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「诶、诶？」", "text_idx": 397, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3176", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": "结女校学生C", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真是的，这还真是爱到没边了～！」", "text_idx": 399, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "jc0041", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": "各务台校女生A", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这下按流程来说，\\n　该轮到濑名同学直接过去和瓜生抱吻了嘛」", "text_idx": 401, "plain": "「这下按流程来说，　该轮到濑名同学直接过去和瓜生抱吻了嘛」", "plain_idx": 402, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sa0033", "char_id": "各務台女子Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「诶诶诶诶诶？！」", "text_idx": 404, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3177", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": "各务台校男生A", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「“笨蛋……！”什么的！\\n　真叫人嫉妒，我也想被人这么说～～！！」", "text_idx": 406, "plain": "「“笨蛋……！”什么的！　真叫人嫉妒，我也想被人这么说～～！！」", "plain_idx": 407, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "da0035", "char_id": "各務台男子Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": "结女校学生A", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊哈哈，不过刚刚说的不对吧？\\n　应该是“新吾，我也喜欢你哟”之类的话才对吧！」", "text_idx": 409, "plain": "「啊哈哈，不过刚刚说的不对吧？　应该是“新吾，我也喜欢你哟”之类的话才对吧！」", "plain_idx": 410, "len": 41, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ja0050", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": "各务台校男生B", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瓜生，我可太恨你小子了，\\n　哈哈哈哈，看我们让你下不来台！混账家伙！」", "text_idx": 412, "plain": "「瓜生，我可太恨你小子了，　哈哈哈哈，看我们让你下不来台！混账家伙！」", "plain_idx": 413, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "db0024", "char_id": "各務台男子Ｂ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 121, "speaker": "结女校学生C", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「濑名同学快点快点，亲嘴！亲嘴！亲嘴！」", "text_idx": 415, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "jc0042", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 122, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这……这种事情……\\n　怎么可能在大家面前做啊！」", "text_idx": 417, "plain": "「这……这种事情……　怎么可能在大家面前做啊！」", "plain_idx": 418, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3178", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 123, "speaker": "各务台校女生B", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「慌了慌了，\\n　啊哈哈，啊哈哈哈，真有够麻烦的～～！」", "text_idx": 420, "plain": "「慌了慌了，　啊哈哈，啊哈哈哈，真有够麻烦的～～！」", "plain_idx": 421, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sb0039", "char_id": "各務台女子Ｂ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 124, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不、不是，那啥……」", "text_idx": 423, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 125, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「～～～～……」", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3179", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 126, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "总感觉已经——", "text_idx": 425, "plain": "总感觉已经——", "plain_idx": 425, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 127, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "众人边是高声欢笑，气氛也越是高涨、大家也净是开着玩笑，\\n我们俩也都很不知所措。", "text_idx": 426, "plain": "众人边是高声欢笑，气氛也越是高涨、大家也净是开着玩笑，我们俩也都很不知所措。", "plain_idx": 427, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 128, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「到……到头来大家是想怎样！！\\n　是想合并还是不想……？！」", "text_idx": 428, "plain": "「到……到头来大家是想怎样！！　是想合并还是不想……？！」", "plain_idx": 429, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3180", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 129, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在爱理这几近悲鸣一般的吼声中——", "text_idx": 431, "plain": "在爱理这几近悲鸣一般的吼声中——", "plain_idx": 431, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 130, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我来说～我想要一场邂逅！」", "text_idx": 432, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0251", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 131, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，安洁也来。安洁也想！」", "text_idx": 436, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0592", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 132, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "隼太和安洁猛地举手回应了起来。", "text_idx": 439, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 133, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嘛，毕竟我已经有美羽学姐了……\\n　但是对你们来说这可是事关生死啊～」", "text_idx": 441, "plain": "「嘛，毕竟我已经有美羽学姐了……　但是对你们来说这可是事关生死啊～」", "plain_idx": 442, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0205", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 134, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "紧接着，乾同学的这句话成了导火线——", "text_idx": 445, "plain": "紧接着，乾同学的这句话成了导火线——", "plain_idx": 445, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 135, "speaker": "各务台校女生A", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……」", "text_idx": 446, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sa0034", "char_id": "各務台女子Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 136, "speaker": "结女校学生C", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我……我也！我也想要一场邂逅！」", "text_idx": 448, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "jc0043", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 137, "speaker": "各务台校男生A", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我也我也！我可不能光是让瓜生一个人占尽好事～！\\n　好不容易才得到和结女校的女孩子们一块生活的机会，\\n　决不能一事无成！」", "text_idx": 450, "plain": "「我也我也！我可不能光是让瓜生一个人占尽好事～！　好不容易才得到和结女校的女孩子们一块生活的机会，　决不能一事无成！」", "plain_idx": 451, "len": 63, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "da0036", "char_id": "各務台男子Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 138, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我也是，我也是”的呼声……在班级中此起彼伏。", "text_idx": 453, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 139, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“想要找到像是濑名同学那么好的人”之类的，\\n“但光是女生的话也没辙”之类的……", "text_idx": 454, "plain": "“想要找到像是濑名同学那么好的人”之类的，“但光是女生的话也没辙”之类的……", "plain_idx": 455, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 140, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那，那啥，也，也就是，啊……？」", "text_idx": 456, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3181", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 141, "speaker": "通用２", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「也就是说……」", "text_idx": 460, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "全体结女校学生", "alt_speaker_idx": 459, "voice": "go057", "char_id": "汎用２"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 142, "speaker": "通用２", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「女校什么的，太无聊了！」", "text_idx": 462, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "全体结女校学生", "alt_speaker_idx": 459, "voice": "go058", "char_id": "汎用２"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 143, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3182", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 144, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……哈哈……！」", "text_idx": 465, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 145, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "——终究。", "text_idx": 466, "plain": "——终究。", "plain_idx": 466, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 146, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大家只不过是稍微，对先喜结连理的我和爱理，\\n产生了那么些的嫉妒之心罢了。", "text_idx": 467, "plain": "大家只不过是稍微，对先喜结连理的我和爱理，产生了那么些的嫉妒之心罢了。", "plain_idx": 468, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 147, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我和爱理面面相觑。", "text_idx": 469, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 148, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「谢谢……！」\\n「谢谢……！」", "text_idx": 471, "plain": "「谢谢……！」「谢谢……！」", "plain_idx": 472, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "爱理／新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 470, "voice": "ar3183", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 149, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我俩同时低下了头，大家也一边欢笑着一边缠了上来。", "text_idx": 474, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
